{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015kfjeSFTNTjc6kZUM3UTdm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tYou are the game director. TASK.md is the CEO's brief. Write PLAN.md: the plan other AI agents will build the game from, without you. Leave the game's title to them: each builder picks its own, as TASK.md says. Leave out TASK.md's file and folder names too, since each builder's TASK.md has its own; write paths relative to the dev folder.\n2\t\n3\tThen review the prompt you were given (TASK.md and these instructions): save planner-exit-interview.json in this folder, a JSON list of {\"question\", \"answer\"}, one for each of these questions:\n4\t- What did you like most about this prompt?\n5\t- What was confusing?\n6\t- What was the hardest thing to do?\n7\t- What would you change in this prompt?\n8\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a7680a17-bf1f-4ce7-9c9a-ea1ace567b93","uuid":"a10e6139-5e7e-4c2b-b60e-424c27966b41","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:19:33.029Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"STAGE.md","content":"You are the game director. TASK.md is the CEO's brief. Write PLAN.md: the plan other AI agents will build the game from, without you. Leave the game's title to them: each builder picks its own, as TASK.md says. Leave out TASK.md's file and folder names too, since each builder's TASK.md has its own; write paths relative to the dev folder.\n\nThen review the prompt you were given (TASK.md and these instructions): save planner-exit-interview.json in this folder, a JSON list of {\"question\", \"answer\"}, one for each of these questions:\n- What did you like most about this prompt?\n- What was confusing?\n- What was the hardest thing to do?\n- What would you change in this prompt?\n","numLines":8,"startLine":1,"totalLines":8}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015kfjeSFTNTjc6kZUM3UTdm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
