ks on a stone block; `angle` throws it (+ toward the front) |\n80\t| `pressure-plate` | 0.9 × 0.09 × 0.9 | size 0.9 (0.5–1.4) | frame slate, groove ink, plate mist, mark red | dungeon, stone, trap, mechanism | Pressure plate: a pale stone tile raised a few centimetres in a dark groove and a slate frame, a red mark on it (map `mark`); the tile is the pivot `plate` to press; `size` metres square |\n81\t| `obelisk` | 1.21 × 3.2 × 1.21 | h 3.2 (2.2–5) | stone mist, stone2 slate, band night, rune cyan | dungeon, stone, monument, magic, light | Stone obelisk on stepped plinths: a tapering shaft, a dark pyramidion and a dark band of small glowing runes (map `rune`, which also lights it); `h` is its height |\n82\t| `rune-stone` | 1.27 × 1.85 × 0.62 | h 1.8 (1.2–2.6) | stone slate, foot mist, carve night, rune cyan | dungeon, stone, magic, light, nature | Standing stone of seeded outline on a few pale footing stones: a dark carved strip down its face holding small glowing runes (map `rune`, which also lights it); `h` is its height |\n83\t| `pillory` | 1.16 × 2.02 × 0.56 |  | wood orange, wood2 red, stone mist, iron night, hole ink, lock sand | dungeon, wood, town | Wooden pillory on a stone footing: a capped post, a split yoke at neck height with a head hole and two hand holes, the upper board on the pivot `yoke` hinged at the left, an iron hasp and a gold lock (map `lock`) |\n84\t| `pit-grate` | 1.68 × 0.33 × 1.68 | r 0.6 (0.4–1) | stone mist, stone2 slate, hole ink, iron night | dungeon, stone, iron, trap | Pit in the floor like a well head: a low curb of stones in two greys round a black hole, under an iron ring and grate of crossed bars (the pivot `grate`); `r` is the hole's radius |\n85\t\n86\t### furniture (19)\n87\t\n88\t| id | size (m, w × h × d) | params: default (min–max) | palette slots | tags | about |\n89\t| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n90\t| `table` | 1.4 × 0.75 × 0.8 | length 1.4 (0.8–2.4), width 0.8 (0.6–1.2) | wood orange, frame red, joint plum | fur